         body='TWO. (continued)\n  WHY success-after-failures(1) IS NOISY:\n    filter     type = login\n    group by   ip (terms)\n    bucket     1h (date_histogram)\n    threshold  params.f >= 1 && params.s >= 1\n    a query cannot say "then": a typo and a success from one\n    address in the same hour is enough  <- MOSTLY FALSE',
